# public/assets/ (gallery images + _manifest.csv + logo) IS tracked in git
# (EMF-36) so any checkout — including a clean/CI one — can build a full,
# image-bearing site and deploy it. Do NOT re-add a `public/assets/` ignore:
# Cloudflare replaces the entire static-asset set on each `wrangler deploy`,
# so an image-less deploy silently WIPES the live /assets/* set (EMF-29/33/36).

